  "description": "A frequently viewed dashboard queries an RDS data source. The company wants faster visualizations and fewer repeated queries against the source database. Which Quick Sight dataset mode is most appropriate?",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>문제 풀이</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 105</p><h1>문제 풀이</h1></div><strong>105 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"105번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:97%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q105\" data-question=\"Q105\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q105</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A frequently viewed dashboard queries an RDS data source. The company wants faster visualizations and fewer repeated queries against the source database. Which Quick Sight dataset mode is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q105\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Direct Query</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q105\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">SPICE</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q105\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS Snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q105\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS FIFO</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">SPICE</a>는 데이터를 메모리 기반 엔진에 가져와 반복적인 분석 쿼리를 빠르게 처리한다. 원본의 변경 사항은 데이터 세트 새로 고침으로 반영한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">QuickSight / Quick Sight</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"문제 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q104/\">이전 문제 <b>Q104</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q106/\">다음 문제 <b>Q106</b></a></span></nav><p class=\"save-note\">선택과 채점 결과는 이 브라우저에 자동 저장됩니다.</p></section>"
